  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 7,
      "end": 13,
      "speaker": "DRIVER",
      "text": "That pothole's still there. They fixed everything except the road."
    },
    {
      "start": 16,
      "end": 22,
      "speaker": "FRONT PASSENGER",
      "text": "Slow down. This car has to get us home as well."
    },
    {
      "start": 26,
      "end": 32,
      "speaker": "YOU",
      "text": "What did the caller actually say?"
    },
    {
      "start": 35,
      "end": 43,
      "speaker": "FRONT PASSENGER",
      "text": "The temple caretaker. He heard people shouting inside. Wouldn't go back through the gate."
    },
    {
      "start": 46,
      "end": 53,
      "speaker": "DRIVER",
      "text": "Three of us for a noise complaint. On market day, too."
    },
    {
      "start": 56,
      "end": 64,
      "speaker": "FRONT PASSENGER",
      "text": "He called twice. The second time he just kept asking how far away we were."
    },
    {
      "start": 68,
      "end": 73,
      "speaker": "YOU",
      "text": "Does anyone still live up there?"
    },
    {
      "start": 76,
      "end": 84,
      "speaker": "DRIVER",
      "text": "Just the caretaker. My grandmother used to take us there when we were small."
    },
    {
      "start": 87,
      "end": 94,
      "speaker": "DRIVER",
      "text": "They said you could hear the bell from the village. Even when nobody rang it."
    },
    {
      "start": 98,
      "end": 104,
      "speaker": "FRONT PASSENGER",
      "text": "Your grandmother told you that so you'd behave."
    },
    {
      "start": 107,
      "end": 113,
      "speaker": "DRIVER",
      "text": "It worked. I didn't like staying after dark."
    },
    {
      "start": 117,
      "end": 123,
      "speaker": "FRONT PASSENGER",
      "text": "The turn's just ahead. He's supposed to meet us by the bridge."
    },
    {
      "start": 127,
      "end": 134,
      "speaker": "FRONT PASSENGER",
      "text": "There it is. Let's find him first, then we go in together."
    }
  ]
}
